{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_015_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b9e17632367f7a653145e68ab2d704714865470c60c4667cd45525a3d3cfa1c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35ed8e6413d107a206adf1a2a0a8b29362d2265a1f37d3267b58a9990bffa296",
      "text": "白色情人节快乐！\n●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bee83fa42ee1bf1c1efe23d3e16be878701ded6565ea352a0a1a2cc2f09a507",
      "text": "我带了情人节的回礼过来。\n这个，快收下吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c90357eda93273ba4c85bbd595ffcb73985384e5a5bc87454d1b9f959dccb3f0",
      "text": "就像我收到了活力一样，\n我也想送一份能带给你活力的东西呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3b406ae48b442523f188b3c4e8f26d670717154de105c132bafe268f9e8b376",
      "text": "我以自己的方式倾注全力准备好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53626f4bd0fe0dff98efcb744bab494c0926aba511249b236eb276753e9f8885",
      "text": "收下这个，今天的工作也一起加油吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a396c0d8c1a3030d16f5beb96d28a219db4c544726b0c9639579d8c355f029d",
      "text": "今天的工作也结束了呢！\n辛苦啦，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df0f29eacfc1e831b2cd885f448788de02039b60e1c373bcd8eab544c2e66575",
      "text": "接下来就只要回事务所了对吧。\n那个啊，我现在有东西想交给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:085f113acf21a418d405a2e676569d466c4728496283e4dd4710e3662f353a84",
      "text": "……呼，好！\n给，这个！白色情人节的回礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:312d022df109b25916af457c4f7d626533de5482fe19055abe9a9f8802e5366a",
      "text": "前阵子不是收到了从●●●●プロデューサー那里\n送来的巧克力嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:177d0ed8f62d790c2cfa50e1117563948768ea886ed6363f06eb52ef197927eb",
      "text": "那个，绝对是幸运巧克力啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60382ae9336e112b3262d651338e209dd8916d8786ed271f8cda895abc544435",
      "text": "吃了它的那天就算碰上了倒霉事，\n也会遇到比那更让人开心的幸运事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fe5a10327a3d91542cf8691a528ddf251c5ab87f99451feb2601f955e063c3d",
      "text": "在这份回礼里，我也为了让制作人\n能遇上幸运的好事，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efc2085893e95c13fd0c981b1a1dbe107466af4de999a692c5ff4c648cd49aba",
      "text": "倾注了满满的心意哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000065:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abe49bc21375ba85a0ec7e5ad7a85a8488159f9f413a5095824bc73ab976aba3",
      "text": "非常感谢。这份心意我很开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000066:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d7f0516eb633ef238fbe664c6595fc50646ec4703511692bd38aa00011ad59a",
      "text": "在收到回礼的瞬间就已经很幸运了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_015_22:5_02_015_22_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9ba7032fa8bb00cfaab4789e4572268e8a833c3f4c5ef669a669dda72757b5d",
      "text": "这样啊！看来你很高兴，太好了！\n这份回礼要是能合你心意就好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
